1. Request microphone permission.
2. Record and transcribe actual speech.
3. Generate actual TTS.
4. Interrupt speech.
5. Capture a user-authorized image.
6. Run real vision analysis.
7. Verify permission and deletion.
8. Verify no background capture without authorization.

## Journey H — M7 Presence

1. Start the persistent event worker.
2. Generate a legitimate test event.
3. Verify priority.
4. Send a genuine test notification.
5. Acknowledge it from a device.
6. Verify other devices receive the updated state.
7. Test quiet hours.
8. Test duplicate suppression.
