1. Pair a real Windows device.
2. Pair a real mobile device.
3. Verify device identities.
4. Review permissions.
5. Test a low-risk operation.
6. Revoke one device.
7. Confirm access is denied.
8. Repeat connection over private LAN.
9. Repeat remote connection through private networking.
