1. Deploy the cloud environment.
2. Connect the Primary Node.
3. Upload a test document.
4. Verify encrypted object storage.
5. Create a project on one device.
6. Verify automatic synchronization.
7. Disconnect another device.
8. Modify permitted records offline.
9. Reconnect.
10. Verify conflict handling and no duplicate operations.
11. Test deletion propagation.
12. Interrupt a storage operation.
13. Recover it.
14. Restore an encrypted backup to a clean environment.
